# Brand

User-facing product name is **Valliani Athena** (`src/lib/brand.ts`: `APP_NAME`).

- UI, titles, splash, login, PWA manifest, voice copy, system prompts → **Valliani Athena**
- AI identity: “You are Valliani Athena…” / “I'm Valliani Athena…”
- Do **not** show “Alexa” as the product name in UI or prompts
- Legacy wake word “Alexa” may still be stripped as a filler; prefer Athena / Valliani Athena
- Do not rename auth cookies (`alexa_session`) or internal `src/lib/alexa/*` module paths unless explicitly asked (breaks sessions / huge refactor)
